#   FUNCTIONS 78 -> 79. `msgCtx` gathers the globals; `onEom` stays in main.zig
#   as a wrapper over `flow.doEom` because `worker.Callbacks.on_eom` is a bare
#   function pointer and cannot carry a context. Against those two, `dupeOrNull`
